r Harbour</span></span></p></td></tr><TR><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>056</span></span></p></td><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>Waikato</span></span></p></td></tr><TR><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>057</span></span></p></td><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>Waimakariri</span></span></p></td></tr><TR><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>058</span></span></p></td><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>Wairarapa</span></span></p></td></tr><TR><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>059</span></span></p></td><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>Waitaki</span></span></p></td></tr><TR><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>060</span></span></p></td><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>Wellington Central</span></span></p></td></tr><TR><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>061</span></span></p></td><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>West Coast-Tasman</span></span></p></td></tr><TR><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>062</span></span></p></td><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>Whanganui</span></span></p></td></tr><TR><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>063</span></span></p></td><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>Whangarei</span></span></p></td></tr><TR><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>064</span></span></p></td><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>Wigram</span></span></p></td></tr><TR><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>999</span></span></p></td><TD><P><SPAN><SPAN>Area Outside General Electoral District</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><P><SPAN><SPAN>Digital boundary data became freely available on 1 July 2007</span></span><SPAN><SPAN>.</span></span></p><P><SPAN /></p><P><SPAN>ArcGIS and MapInfo formats do not support the use of macrons. Macrons have applied to the following general electorate names:</span></p><UL><LI><P><SPAN>Mângere</span></p></li><LI><P><SPAN>Ôhâriu</span></p></li><LI><P><SPAN>Ôtaki</span></p></li><LI><P><SPAN>Rangitῑkei</span></p></li><LI><P><SPAN>Tâmaki</span></p></li><LI><P><SPAN>Taupô</span></p></li><LI><P><SPAN>Te Atatû</span></p></li><LI><P><SPAN>Kaikôura</span></p></li></ul><P><SPAN /></p></div></div></div></p>",
